    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The shift from demanding Dominion Status (Nehru Report, 1928) to Purna Swaraj (Lahore Session, 1929) is a frequently asked transition.",
        "The Poona Pact (1932) substituted separate electorates for depressed classes with reserved seats.",
        "The Simon Commission (1927) was boycotted entirely because it lacked any Indian representation."
      ],
